'''Death's Oath''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Astral Plate}}. 

==Mechanics==
[[List of unique items granting skills|Grants]] {{sl|Death Aura}}.

The Death Aura skill triggered by Death's Oath is affected by any relevant support gem that is also socketed in Death's Oath. It does not require the socket to be linked.

Since the [[active skill|skill]] is triggered by the item rather than a [[active skill gem|skill gem]], it is not affected by {{il|Empower}}, {{il|Enlighten}}, or {{il|Enhance}}. As the aura is activated by trigger, it cannot be supported by [[Blessing skill]]s.

Self damage from the debuff granted by Death's Oath does not stack.

{{ml|ItemBloodFootstepsUniqueBodyStr3}}: Death's Oath has the {{il|Gore Footprints Effect}} applied to it. This is purely cosmetic.

