The legacy versions do not grant {{sl|Death Aura}} skill, but instead grant a debuff that have AOE: "Death's Oath" (internal id: "unique_deaths_oath_aura"). It has a radius of 3 metres (30 units).{{efn|name=legacymod}} It also uses the same visual icon as Chaos {{stl|Degeneration Aura}}, and have the status icon text: "You are taking Chaos Damage over time".

